Palm's Clock (com.palm.app.clock 3.1.1904), as shipped on HP webOS 3.x.

Copyright Palm, Inc. / Hewlett-Packard. Never released under an open licence; distributed by
Lunacy as abandonware, like Mojo, the Prelude fonts and the TouchPad wallpapers: no owner has
asserted rights since webOS was discontinued.

Copied from the reference TouchPad, where it is pre-installed but lives in the user area of
the filesystem (/media/cryptofs/apps). The app is here exactly as it was packaged, and Lunacy
does not change it (rule 5 in CLAUDE.md). The build scripts and specs that shipped beside it
(Rakefile, Gemfile, build.sh, ci_build.sh, spec/) are left out; nothing else is.
